```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Frontend
    participant MetaMask
    participant Smart Contract
    participant Blockchain

    User->>Frontend: Select Election & Ballot Preferences
    User->>Frontend: Click "Submit Ballot"
    
    Frontend->>Frontend: Construct Transaction (castBallot)
    Frontend->>MetaMask: Send Transaction Request
    
    MetaMask->>User: Display Transaction & Gas Estimation
    User->>MetaMask: Confirm Transaction
    
    MetaMask->>Blockchain: Broadcast Signed Transaction
    Blockchain->>Smart Contract: Execute castBallot(electionId, prefs)
    
    Smart Contract->>Smart Contract: Require: electionExists
    Smart Contract->>Smart Contract: Require: electionActive
    Smart Contract->>Smart Contract: Require: isEligibleVoter[msg.sender]
    Smart Contract->>Smart Contract: Require: !hasVoted[msg.sender]
    
    Smart Contract->>Smart Contract: Record Vote
    Smart Contract->>Blockchain: Emit VoteCast Event
    
    Blockchain-->>MetaMask: Transaction Confirmed
    MetaMask-->>Frontend: Transaction Hash Receipt
    
    Frontend-->>User: Display Success Confirmation & TX Hash
```
